   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there a equivalent of Stan&#39;s adj() operator (see page 8 of <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1509.07164.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://arxiv.org/pdf/1509.07164.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YvAHiY8z_Q5eUPpyPcg_Q\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1509.07164.pdf</a>) to calculate derivatives of the objective function within the TMB cpp function definition?  Here is some example Stan code (taken from: <a href=\"http://tobiasmadsen.com/2017/03/31/automatic_differentiation_in_r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://tobiasmadsen.com/2017/03/31/automatic_differentiation_in_r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12EoFr5P0YkhxS89hohUDP\">http://tobiasmadsen.com/2017/03/31/automatic_differentiation_in_r/</a>), see the bit where the gradient is computed:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:0.85rem;padding:1em;line-height:1.5;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(245,242,240);word-break:normal;overflow:auto\"><code style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.5;background:none;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">#</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">include</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,153,0)\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;Rcpp.h&gt;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">#</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">include</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(102,153,0)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">using</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">namespace</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rcpp</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(112,128,144)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">// [[Rcpp::export]]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">NumericVector</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">normLogLikAD</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">NumericVector</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">ret</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#008\">var</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#008\">var</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#008\">var</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#008\">var</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lp </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  lp </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">log</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">log</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">PI</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(112,128,144)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">// Compute Function Value</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ret</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lp</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">val</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(112,128,144)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">// Compute Gradient</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  lp</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">grad</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ret</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">adj</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ret</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">adj</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ret</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,0,85)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">adj</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(112,128,144)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">// Memory is allocated on a global stack</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">recover_memory</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  stan</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">math</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#606\">ChainableStack</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(154,110,58);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">memalloc_</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(221,74,104)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">free_all</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,119,170)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ret</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(153,153,153)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></span></code></pre></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br><br><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
