   "subject": "Re: Get objective function derivative within cpp code",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Would the autodiff namespace help for your problem?<br>Example taken from the TMB Documentation: <a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35oX6A3hnf7C6RoeeCmw8r\">https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html</a><div>Similarly you can compute the Hessian and Jacobian.<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><pre style=\"padding:1em;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.5;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(245,242,240);word-break:normal;overflow:auto\"><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,96,32)\">#include &lt;<a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/TMB_8hpp.html\" style=\"color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/TMB_8hpp.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pMG1x5D-VmWJP-xs9oZRk\">TMB.hpp</a>&gt;</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\"></div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">struct </span>func {</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">template</span> &lt;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">class</span> T&gt;</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  T operator()(<a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structvector.html\" style=\"color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structvector.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3re-GyUubgqLylAs9RV2Vi\">vector&lt;T&gt;</a> x){  <span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">// Evaluate function</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">    <span style=\"color:rgb(224,128,0)\">return</span> exp( -x.sum() );</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  }</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">};</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\"></div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">template</span>&lt;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">class</span> Type&gt;</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Type objective_function&lt;Type&gt;::operator() () {</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  <a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/group__macros.html#ga6b8a70eeee38fe896e89e0a9c6bef84a\" style=\"color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/group__macros.html%23ga6b8a70eeee38fe896e89e0a9c6bef84a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462292694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1b09MEqHKr0JMSSMj6Z8PN\">PARAMETER_VECTOR</a>(theta);</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  func f;</div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  <span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">// Calculate gradient</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:53px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-family:monospace,fixed;min-height:13px;white-space:pre-wrap\">  <a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structvector.html\" style=\"color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kask